in until the call  of the chair  good luck  appreciate all you did thank you strong  now  [Music]  good  [Music]  good  foreign  yes  you can hear more about the iraq weapons  inspections tomorrow morning at 9 15  eastern as scott ritter joins us on our  washington journal program  we invite your thoughts and questions on  the topic by phone fax and email  washington journal airs weekdays at 7  eastern 4 pacific here on c-span

